   "lede": "Helsinki remains snow-free on Friday. Measurements at Kaisaniemi, Kumpula, Espoo Tapiola, the airport and Nuuksio all show bare ground. While northern cities like Oulu and Rovaniemi are already white, the capital sits on the wrong side of a sharp weather divide that runs through mid-Finland.",
